    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Kyle Tucker** (85.90) serving as our undisputed anchor. Facing a favorable matchup against the hittable Tomoyuki Sugano (4.93 xERA), **Kyle Tucker** benefits from a massive park factor boost (+14%) and strong SP skill synergy, making him an elite start. **Andy Pages** (74.42) and **Drake Baldwin** (71.20) are the only other players crossing the 70-point threshold; **Andy Pages** enjoys the same favorable venue as **Kyle Tucker**, while **Drake Baldwin** is poised to exploit a high-xERA matchup against Bailey Ober. These three serve as the core of today\u2019s offensive strategy, providing the highest probability of output across our 5x5 categories.\n\nIn terms of bench decisions, **Jackson Merrill** (53.97) remains the most critical pivot point. He narrowly outperformed several other fringe options, but ultimately earned the UTIL spot due to his dynamic platoon advantage (+13%) against Nolan McLean, which outweighed the negative SP skill impact. Conversely, **Gunnar Henderson** (52.61) and **Miguel Vargas** (51.34) occupy \"Marginal\" territory; while their raw talent is high, their platoon splits against Shota Imanaga act as a significant drag on their daily efficiency scores. We continue to monitor the status of **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** and **Jordan Westburg**, who remain sidelined on the IL, while **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** and **Heliot Ramos** are omitted today due to scheduling gaps. \n\nManagers should be wary of the reliance on \"Lineup Pending\" status, particularly for **Liam Hicks** and **Coby Mayo**, whose final batting order placement could further impact their sub-60 scores. While **Luis Robert Jr.** (51.56) provides a high ceiling, his -15% platoon penalty against Walker Buehler necessitates close monitoring. Our depth players\u2014**Nasim Nunez**, **Josh Jung**, **Curtis Mead**, **Wade Meckler**, and **Luis Lara**\u2014remain ready to pinch-hit should late lineup scratches occur, though no immediate changes to the starting group are projected at this time.",
